WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,110 --> 00:00:02,180
Thank you very much. What are you thanking for?

2
00:00:02,580 --> 00:00:03,820
It's what I should do

3
00:00:04,940 --> 00:00:07,180
You're going to suffer sooner or later if you don't like sucking your body so much

4
00:00:07,860 --> 00:00:09,060
So take good care of yourself now

5
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:10,580
I already told your secretary

6
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:11,980
Tell him that you have been sick for the past two days

7
00:00:11,980 --> 00:00:13,100
Maybe they weren’t even sent to the company.

8
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:15,940
Ask him to send you the information about the medicine well. What are you doing?

9
00:00:16,140 --> 00:00:18,620
Okay, why do you want to ask for leave for me? If you don’t want to ask for leave, it’s your situation.

10
00:00:18,620 --> 00:00:19,620
Are you still planning to return to the company?

11
00:00:19,620 --> 00:00:21,620
I know you do it for my own good, but what happened today

12
00:00:21,620 --> 00:00:22,620
It's really important

13
00:00:22,900 --> 00:00:23,900
One has already been reserved

14
00:00:23,900 --> 00:00:29,640
A meeting that absolutely cannot be postponed. I will wait until I finish the meeting and go back to the company to finish the meeting and then come back to the meeting.

15
00:00:29,640 --> 00:00:30,560
I've already asked the secretary

16
00:00:31,080 --> 00:00:32,760
Mainly to reform the company's sales network

17
00:00:33,040 --> 00:00:35,120
It's also something you've been preparing for, right?

18
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:36,640
Since you know, you should know

19
00:00:36,640 --> 00:00:38,280
How important is this to me and the company?

20
00:00:38,280 --> 00:00:39,240
so i have to go back

21
00:00:40,310 --> 00:00:41,870
This thing has been around for a long time

22
00:00:41,870 --> 00:00:42,950
You have been preparing for so long

23
00:00:42,950 --> 00:00:44,150
Why are you still in such a hurry?

24
00:00:44,150 --> 00:00:46,470
You also said that this matter is very important, the more important it is

25
00:00:46,470 --> 00:00:47,390
The less anxious you can be

26
00:00:48,030 --> 00:00:49,070
What if something goes wrong?

27
00:00:49,470 --> 00:00:50,950
Not to mention your current physical condition

28
00:00:51,270 --> 00:00:52,270
Do you think you can handle it?

29
00:00:52,510 --> 00:00:55,830
Can you please not be so kind as to help us? This concerns us.

30
00:00:55,830 --> 00:00:57,310
Forgotten turnover adjustments during off-season

31
00:00:57,630 --> 00:00:59,350
And it has been planned for so long

32
00:00:59,470 --> 00:01:02,350
Of course we need to see results as soon as possible, so I don’t want you to wait any longer.
